4775\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/a5142117da427b48c51f93c2c042a3b4.webp?t=1681114775\" /></div> <strong>STORY</strong><br>Travel to the past through the Time Rifts. Discover the long-lost secrets of Pangea's heroes and help them attain their true potential with unique magic items!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/208fdce260d67a51d20bf47fe2322cfa.poster.avif?t=1681114775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/208fdce260d67a51d20bf47fe2322cfa.webm?t=1681114775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/208fdce260d67a51d20bf47fe2322cfa.mp4?t=1681114775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/39780ff9f3699f65ed94764d88a0c0bd.webp?t=1681114775\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/a5142117da427b48c51f93c2c042a3b4.webp?t=1681114775\" /></div> <strong>DUNGEONS</strong><br>The Bone Dragon's dungeon is dark and full of terrors... but it's also full of treasures! Defeat all the monsters and find your way out of the maze until you run out of Life Stones.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/daba33b5e2f243368915a7b2b683274f.poster.avif?t=1681114775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/951480/extras/daba33b5e2f243368915a7b2b683274f.webm?t=168